          "title": "Guillotine",
          "subtitle": "Accumulation",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Guillotine is a commercial card game where players manipulate a line of nobles and collect the most valuable heads over three days."
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Created by Paul Peterson and published in 1998, Guillotine is a humorous dedicated-deck card game built around queue manipulation and point collection."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
